From db7d14111f7e462d74c18504b1909f09bd0c3214 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:16:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 71/74] net: ipa: add SM8750 compatible

SM8750 has IPA v5.5.2, like Eliza. The OnePlus SM8750 downstream
driver uses the same 68-counter Q6 FnR memory layout and the same
endpoint map as the Eliza data, so reuse ipa_data_v5_5_eliza.

The device tree falls back to qcom,sm8550-ipa, like SM8650.

Signed-off-by: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml | 1 +
 drivers/net/ipa/ipa_main.c                          | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
index e4b14ddf8..101f739e7 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
@@ -62,6 +62,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - qcom,eliza-ipa
               - qcom,sm8650-ipa
+              - qcom,sm8750-ipa
           - const: qcom,sm8550-ipa
 
   reg:
diff --git a/drivers/net/ipa/ipa_main.c b/drivers/net/ipa/ipa_main.c
index 1e53a61c3..db2b951bb 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ipa/ipa_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ipa/ipa_main.c
@@ -644,6 +644,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id ipa_match[] = {
 		.compatible	= "qcom,eliza-ipa",
 		.data		= &ipa_data_v5_5_eliza,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible	= "qcom,sm8750-ipa",
+		.data		= &ipa_data_v5_5_eliza,
+	},
 	{
 		.compatible	= "qcom,msm8998-ipa",
 		.data		= &ipa_data_v3_1,
-- 
2.56.0

